<v Ira Glass>Pan-pan？

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:34.860
<v Eric Kaufman>Pan-pan, yeah. Pan-pan, pan-pan, pan-pan. This is the sailing vessel Rebel Heart at position da-da-da-da-da. Yeah.
<v Eric Kaufman>Pan-pan，是的。Pan-pan，Pan-pan，Pan-pan。这是帆船“反抗之心”（Rebel Heart）号，位置在……等等。是的。

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:36.180
<v Ira Glass>OK.
<v Ira Glass>好的。

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:40.000
<v Eric Kaufman>So we started doing the pan-pans and didn't get anything back.
