<v Charlotte Kaufman>Yeah.
<v Charlotte Kaufman>是的。

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:17.860
<v Ira Glass>Now, it's not just that they're three weeks from where they're going. Where they're going is incredibly rustic-- the Marquesas island chain in French Polynesia.
