00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:29.510
<v Ira Glass>Now, of course, if they take action, if they use the EPIRB-- remember the EPIRB is the emergency device that calls for help-- nobody is going to tow their boat to safety, they're boat which they had been living on, their boat that was their whole life. Nobody was going to pick them up, and save their daughter, and then return them to their boat later.
<v Ira Glass>当然，如果他们采取行动，如果他们使用EPIRB——记得EPIRB是呼叫救援的紧急设备——没人会把他们的船拖到安全地带，他们一直居住的那艘船，他们一生的那艘船。没人会接走他们，救了他们的女儿，然后以后把船还给他们。

